-treatment<\/b><\/strong><\/h4><p>For Anti-static needle PE\/Polyester needle punched felt, we can treat it with\u00a0different post-processing according to different working conditions.\u00a0There are mainly the following post-processing treatments:<\/p><ol><li>Water&amp;OilRepellent<\/li><li>PTFE Membrane<\/li><li>PTFE Impregnation<\/li><\/ol><h4><strong><b>Shapes and Types<\/b><\/strong><\/h4><p>Anti-static needle PE\/Polyester needle felt can be made into different types of filter bags, which can be mainly divided into the following three types according to different shapes:<\/p><ol><li>Roundtype<\/li><li>Flat type<\/li><li>Star\/pleated type<\/li><\/ol>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0c7a5a0 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"0c7a5a0\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c40c56e elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"c40c56e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"943\" height=\"214\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/shapes-4-\u8be6\u60c51.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-3132\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/shapes-4-\u8be6\u60c51.png 943w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/shapes-4-\u8be6\u60c51-300x68.png 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/shapes-4-\u8be6\u60c51-768x174.png 768w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/shapes-4-\u8be6\u60c51-600x136.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 943px) 100vw, 943px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ele